2341
00:54:53,460 --> 00:54:55,460
<font size="64">- If we crouch... - This might work.</font>

2342
00:54:54,530 --> 00:54:57,470
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's hot, but it's a perfect spot.)</font>

2343
00:54:55,460 --> 00:54:57,330
